    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        143,
        1721,
        1423,
        1861
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Fund is supported by the entire community and city employees are being asked to do their share. I, therefore, request that you and all your employees join together in a massive effort to raise money needed to support the Fund.",
